Image UPloader (GPL).

Sample configuration file for l4be uploader:
<-- cut -->

service l4be
{
	type		= UNLISTED
	disable		= no
	socket_type	= stream
	wait		= no
	user		= mouse
	server		= /home/mouse/Linux4BE/loader/l4be
	server_args	= /home/mouse/Linux4BE/loader
	port		= 13131
}

<-- cut -->

You must pass work-directory as argument for l4be program
Work-directory must contains all necessary image files or symlinks, f.e. vmlinux

Enjoy!

Questions & comments please send to mouse@altlinux.ru

Rgds,
Anton
